"""The top of every scan page of one real City of Vancouver minutes item, for testing verify/dates.py on a whole item.

Source: https://archive.org/details/CVAN_1967-05-30 (`CVAN_1967-05-30_hocr_searchtext.txt.gz`, cut at its page index,
fetched 2026-10-27), the first 250 characters of each of its 70 scan pages, unchanged. Scan pages 0-19 are the Regular
Council of May 30, 1967; 20-33 the Special and Adjourned Councils of June 1; 34-69 reports of the Board of
Administration dated May 12 and May 26, bound in after them, each stamped by the clerk "MAY 30 1967" (often garbled by
the OCR), the council meeting that received them. No meeting was held on May 12 or May 26.
"""

